📊 Day 41 Power BI Coding Challenge
Finance Domain Analysis Dashboard Using Power BI
🚀 Project Overview

This project is part of my Day 41 Code Challenge focused on the Finance Domain using Power BI.

The objective of this project is to analyze company financial performance and identify:

✅ Profit drivers
✅ High performing regions
✅ Product revenue insights
✅ Customer profitability
✅ Revenue trends
✅ Discount impact on profit

This dashboard helps businesses make data driven financial decisions using interactive visualizations and DAX calculations.

