📌 Task 1: Calculated Columns (DAX)
✅ Profit Margin

Formula:

Profit Margin=
Revenue
Profit
	​


Profit Margin =
Sheet1[Profit] / Sheet1[Revenue]
✅ Discount Value

Formula:

Discount Value=Revenue×Discount

Discount Value =
Sheet1[Revenue] * Sheet1[Discount]
📌 Task 2: Measures
✅ Total Revenue
Total Revenue =
SUM(Sheet1[Revenue])
✅ Total Profit
Total Profit =
SUM(Sheet1[Profit])
✅ Profit Margin %

Formula:

Profit Margin %=
Total Revenue
Total Profit
	​


Profit Margin % =
DIVIDE([Total Profit], [Total Revenue])
